²NameDateSeptember 26, 2025TitleUPDATE 15 ğŸ›¡Imagerbxassetid://108294156233914Codepatchnotes_season1ChangesscriptğŸ‚ SEASON 1Description(Welcome to Season 1 â€” The Warp Season!ªThis is the first ever season reset! That means there's a brand new Ranked season, the first ever set of Ranked rewards, & the introduction of the first ever Season Pass!MNot only that, but there's a brand new map, new rewards, and much, much more!;Check out all of the brand new "Warp" themed content below!	Thumbnailrbxassetid://76121468587359The brand new Sensei & Co. roomğŸ”« WEAPONSfWe've had "Standard" weapons & we've also had "Prime" weapons. Now introducing.. "Contraband" weapons!”Contraband weapons are ultra rare, ultra special weapons that are just that much cooler than Prime weapons. The top of the top weapons in the world.SThe first set of Contraband weapons are now available in the brand new Season Pass!˜Distortion â€” The brand new, Contraband primary weapon that's able to consume nearby players with a gravitational vortex! Available in the Season Pass!rbxassetid://1167811528372124The brand new Contraband primary weapon "Distortion"¤Warper â€” The brand new, Contraband secondary weapon that's able to open portals and warp players between any distance instantly! Available in the Season 1 Bundle!rbxassetid://736813410184462The brand new Contraband secondary weapon "Warper"”Warpstone â€” The brand new, Prime utility weapon that can be thrown to instantly warp to a desired location! Available for FREE in the Season Pass!rbxassetid://112410107324359.The brand new Prime utility weapon "Warpstone"©While most Season Pass rewards are only available to earn for a limited time during the season, we believe that weapons should always be obtainable regardless of when you start playing the game (RIVALS). These weapons will permanently go onsale for a fair amount of keys after this season is over!Check out the Season Pass now!ğŸ›¡ SEASON PASS#The first ever Season Pass is here!dEarn FREE keys, charms, wraps, finishers, emotes, skins, and even a weapon just by playing the game!rbxassetid://133993700895900The first ever Season Pass]Every time your Season Pass levels up, you get a free reward! Level it up by gaining Pass XP!•Pass XP can be earned simply by winning rounds in any kind of duel OR by simply playing the game! You can level up your Season Pass 7 times per week!rbxassetid://118301626429590)This is how you level up your Season Pass²Want access to even more rewards? The best kind of loot? Maybe even a Contraband weapon, free skin cases, & even more of everything else? Check out the Prime Season Pass upgrade!§Check out the Season 1 Bundle to get an insane value deal that includes the Prime Season Pass upgrade, a brand new Contraband weapon, an exclusive skin, and much more!rbxassetid://1140614645708351Look at all the cool stuff in the Season 1 BundleµThe Season Pass can be found by pressing the "Pass" button at the bottom of your screen in the lobby. All rewards, offers, and relevant bundles can be found in the Season Pass page!ğŸ† RANKED SEASONSeason 0 has ended! All ranked players that participated in this experimental season have received the new Season 0 charm and a bunch of Glory!•The top 200 Archnemesis players worldwide from last season have also been given the brand new, exclusive, Mythical Arch Katana skin! Congratulations!rbxassetid://86754678822547CA look at the "Season 0" charm and the top 200 reward "Arch Katana"ÂGlory is the brand new currency given out to all ranked players. You get more Glory based on your final ELO in the season & your total Ranked wins! Spend your Glory in the brand new Ranked Shop!BFor transparency purposes, this is the exact Glory Payout formula:Description271,250 Ã— RANKED_WINS / 250 + 1,250 Ã— FINAL_ELO / 3,600TIn the formula, RANKED_WINS and FINAL_ELO have a limit of 250 and 3,600 respectivelyrbxassetid://104883063044519 The new Ranked currency, "Glory"©Now that there's a new season, that means there's new free rewards to grind for! The Phoenix Rifle has been discontinued and replaced with the brand new Ranked Contract!ÒYou can now earn Glory, exclusive charms, wraps, finishers, & finally a brand new free skin from the new Ranked Contract feature! You can find the Ranked Contract in the Ranked page after you finish placements!rbxassetid://85692311137157%The brand new Ranked Contract rewardsÿLast but not least, you should expect to see much fairer matchups in Ranked moving forward. Players in the top ranks will experience slightly longer matchmaking times to ensure they get quality duels and to prevent them from stomping lower ranked players.‚However, our matchmaker may still make mistakes once in a blue moon. Rest assured that the ELO gains/losses will compensate for this. If you are matched up against players much higher of a rank than you, you will either gain more or lose less ELO than usual.ğŸ… RANKED SHOP#The first ever Ranked Shop is here!FSpend the hard-earned Glory from Ranked right here in the Ranked Shop!The Ranked Shop contains charms, wraps, finishers, emotes, & even skins that can all be earned for FREE just by playing Ranked!The Glorious weapon skins can be purchased once all Glorious cosmetics have been purchased in order! Check out the Ranked Shop to learn more!rbxassetid://82385276747900'Spend your Glory in the new Ranked Shop	ğŸ›’ SHOPwThe Shop's home page has been revamped! Loose shop items have been seperated into two sections by the Season Pass card!~The brand new Ranked Shop is here! Click on the "Ranked" tab to see more, only available to players that have Ranked unlocked!bThe Gifting, Weapons, & Codes buttons have moved! Click on the "More" tab in the Shop to see them!rbxassetid://108673755455714The new Home page in the ShopEThe Shadow Ink wrap has been replaced by the new Hologram Arena wrap!;The Triplaser wrap has been replaced by the new Honey wrap!rbxassetid://946394587308312"Honey" on the left, "Hologram Arena" on the right—Psst.. you can now also buy Skin Cases for FREE. Collect enough Skin Tickets from the Season Pass and you'll be able to buy a Skin Case of your choice!»Not allowed to purchase lootboxes? No worries! Skins in the Daily Shop are now onsale for Skin Tickets, too! However, refreshing your Daily Shop will disable this for the rest of the day.rbxassetid://981475421324912Purchase skins for FREE using the new Skin TicketsğŸ”® DIMENSION1A brand new, permanent map is here â€” Dimension!°A realm where all realities converge. Two distant childhood memories of company leaders blur into one â€” drifting through the void and ripping through all planes of existence.Made by @GreatGuyBoom!rbxassetid://72743815851430(The brand new permanent map, "Dimension"ğŸ® GAMEPLAY[Projectile weapons, such as Bow or Daggers, should feel much more responsive and consistent:You can now challenge someone to a 1v1 from the Party page[Destructable objects in maps, such as explosive barrels & windows, now respawn every round!0Removed an out-of-bounds area in the Station mapTAdded a ledge on both sides of the Construction map that used to only be on one side>Removed an invisible wall above a ramp in the Battleground map>You no longer lose points from melee eliminations in Gun Game!NYou no longer have reduced health when you're on the final weapon in Gun Game!MThe final weapon in Gun Game, the Glast Shard, now allows you to double jump!@Shorty, Katana, Knife, & Trowel have been removed from Gun Game!ğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESBalancingOverviewBowShotgunRevolverShortyUziFlamethrowerEnergy PistolsHandgunMedkitWar HornHeader/ğŸ“ "The recent nerf to the Bow was too harsh"1ğŸ’ª Charge duration decreased from 2.3s â†’ 1.8sPğŸ“ "The Flamethrower was too difficult to counter for how easy it was to play"-ğŸ”» Move Speed decreased from Normal â†’ -5%:ğŸ“ "The recent Shotgun rework unintentionally nerfed it"AğŸ’ª Damage Dropoff start range increased from 0studs â†’ 10studs:ğŸ’ª Damage Dropoff end damage increased from 18.75 â†’ 25Energy PistolHğŸ“ "The Energy Pistol's high mobility was frustrating to play against""ğŸ”» Movement speed +5% â†’ NormalTğŸ“ "The recent input-queuing changes made the Handgun much stronger than expected"$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 13 â†’ 121ğŸ”» Equip cooldown increased from 0.13s â†’ 0.2sHğŸ“ "The Revolver's slower equip speed made it hard to justify picking"BğŸ’ª Damage Dropoff start range increased from 50studs â†’ 75studs3ğŸ“ "The Shorty was too reliant on the Freeze Ray"BğŸ’ª Damage Dropoff start range increased from 0studs â†’ 7.5studs3ğŸ“ "The Uzi lacked viability in the current meta"3ğŸ’ª Shoot Cooldown decreased from 0.075s â†’ 0.07s;ğŸ“ "Full healing with the Medkit is too easy to pull off"0ğŸ”» Full heal duration increased from 5s â†’ 6s/ğŸ“ "The War Horn ends rounds way too quickly",ğŸ”» Speed Boost decreased from +35% â†’ 30%,ğŸ’ª Speed Duration increased from 5s â†’ 6s
ğŸ›  OTHERcShooting Range dummies have been recolored to red. The DPS dummies are now randomly yellow / purpleCYou can now equip the same emote multiple times in your emote wheelGThe weapon indicator on cosmetic and reward slots is now less intrusive(The Free Rewards page has been refreshed Improved Prime Weapon UI visualsNew Mythical rarity coloriHigh ELO ranked players can now see a countdown for when their ELO will begin to decay in the Ranked pageDSlightly changed the wrap groups on the Hyper Sniper skin for SniperğŸ› BUG FIXES_Fixed a bug where you could see enemies behind a wall for a brief moment after you stop emoting>Fixed a bug where emotes sometimes wouldn't stop playing musicFFixed a bug where sometimes players couldn't respawn in Arcade Servers`Fixed a visual bug where players with lower sensitivities would experience higher viewmodel swayRFixed a visual bug with the Peppergun skin when you reload shortly after equippingKFixed a bug where the Desert Eagle skin could equip faster than other skinsHFixed a bug where the Void Pistols skin equipped slower than other skinsUFixed a bug where the Hide HUD keybind would activate while typing in the chat window;Fixed a bug where Satchels wouldn't stick onto Riot Shields^Fixed a visual bug where players would flash red after shooting themselves with splash weaponsKFixed a bug where players couldn't respawn in the Hardcore Parkour gamemodeLFixed a bug where the Katana deflect particles would disappear while emotingBFixed a bug where Elixir would cancel the Medkit healing animationhFixed a bug where equipping the Riot Shield in your off hand in Double Trouble wouldn't block any damage^Fixed a visual bug where Riot Shields wouldn't be placed on your back properly when unequippedbFixed a bug where players wouldn't be teleported into a rematch if they were in the Shooting RangeKFixed a rare bug that caused players not to spawn in at the start of roundsjFixed a visual bug that caused some players to incorrectly show up as Archnemesis in the Duel History page:Fixed a visual bug with the traffic cones in the Docks mapcFixed a bug where players were able to teleport out of a matchmade duel during the countdown screenWFixed a bug where you would get stuck under the ramps in the Splash and Big Splash mapsIFixed a rare bug where players could purchase shop items they already ownğŸ“œ A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS¤We have nothing new to say really besides addressing the new weapons maybe? We would like to iterate that we will NEVER make limited-time weapons, the closest we'll get is early-access-style weapons like what we did last year during the holidays and what we're doing now with the Season Pass.¯We would also like to state that Contraband weapons are not meant to be crazy overpowered weapons that dominate every match, we just want them to be extremely unique weapons that stand out way more than Prime weapons. With that being said, we'll keep an eye on these new weapons and balance accordingly.¼Phew, big update! Thank you all for taking the time to check it out! Please welcome our newest full-time developer @GreatGuyBoom, big shoutout to him for helping make this update possible!␀ƒ)␀␀
